{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bloxolotl is a cozy puzzle game all about cute block-shaped Axolotls and connecting them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Headline_Move.png?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game features all varieties of Block-shaped Axolotls \u2013 Bloxolotls. You can wake them up and move them around. But they can only move in certain directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Blocks.gif?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Headline_Connect.png?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most of the Bloxolotl's have sticky sides. The Puzzles require you to connect them in a clever way. By doing that, you can combine their movement abilities. But be careful, connections can't be undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/BlockConnect.gif?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Headline_Yummy.png?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bloxolotls are hungry by nature. Every Puzzle asks you to feed them some fruit. Yummy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Eat.gif?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Headline_Map.png?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are over 50 Levels in four different zones with distinct mechanics.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wilson","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/4973931e088bdb3afb0a4c1b560f421ec3dc28d1.jpg"},{"name":"Turn over a new leaf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/757320ab290e3b12af414717b963c7d431ce6791.jpg"},{"name":"Bloxofrogger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/87b0b39dbe3c345e5b8b57080342bad839b1c66a.jpg"},{"name":"It Belongs in a Museum!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/35f6e3d8c6ddf1a8253e0a658b43b33e9fdb736d.jpg"},{"name":"Lava Jam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/8adcc7514ef611fed4d1f706ea65041f305d6280.jpg"},{"name":"Berry Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/a63790d0abf60bd3c8a4a03d589e608aed90f33d.jpg"},{"name":"First Bite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/4c48ecae8a70024ae9d8e7c4e89bcaccba35484b.jpg"},{"name":"Is there cake on the other side?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/f53c91679c1642dabd5e7e9568ded1b823a83f8b.jpg"},{"name":"Spaghettified Bloxolotl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/f59047625768218466e2064b7ddba35fc00d3fe7.jpg"},{"name":"Picassolotl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945940/e7b4c750124a95a783f078bbb3bc12b72c17bac3.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945940?t=1738507136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738507136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta