assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Headline_Yummy.png?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bloxolotls are hungry by nature. Every Puzzle asks you to feed them some fruit. Yummy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Eat.gif?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/extras/Headline_Map.png?t=1738507136\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are over 50 Levels in four different zones with distinct mechanics.</p>","developers":["MGandi"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945940/header.jpg?t=1738507136","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257019881,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257019881/movie480.mp4?t=1738028314","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257019881/movie_max.mp4?t=1738028314"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257019881/fa6608c9164a01c989d3e6c6a59de2a2b473d317/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738028314","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257019881/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738028314","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257019881/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738028314"}}],"name":"Bloxolotl","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":